  "description": "A short page: the same first-entry path as case02 over four records, so the forward loop at :300-306 ends on end of file rather than on the subscript. READNEXT reports ENDFILE on its fifth call, so :302's guard fails, POPULATE-USER-DATA is not performed and WS-IDX stops at 5 - which is why rows 5 to 10 stay at the spaces :292-296 blanked them to, and why row 5 is blank rather than holding a fifth record. :308 is false, so the ELSE at :317-322 runs: NEXT-PAGE-NO, and because WS-IDX is 5 and therefore greater than 1, the COMPUTE at :320-321 still counts the short page as page 1 (gate G28). Note that INITIALIZE-USER-DATA at :446-501 blanks USRIDnn, FNAMEnn, LNAMEnn and UTYPEnn only - never the SELnnnn cell - so the selection column is untouched by the blanking pass.",
